{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"34":{"eng-name":"Clothing (Kitab Al-Libas)","ara-name":"كتاب اللباس"}},"section_detail":{"34":{"hadithnumber_first":4020,"hadithnumber_last":4158,"arabicnumber_first":4020,"arabicnumber_last":4158}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4033,"arabicnumber":4033,"text":"Rapporté par Abu Burdah رضي الله عنه : Mon père m’a dit : « Mon fils, si tu nous avais vus alors que nous étions avec le Messager d’Allah ﷺ et que la pluie tombait sur nous, tu aurais pensé que notre odeur était celle des moutons. »","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":34,"hadith":14},"chapter":{"id":6,"ara-name":"باب فِي لُبْسِ الصُّوفِ وَالشَّعْرِ","eng-name":"Regarding Wearing Wool And Hair","isFirstHadith":false}}]}